Trimmed real data (ruling T1), edited where noted.

git/github.com/fontsource/fontsource/ holds 9 of the 2,168 families of the
Fontsource registry (registry/data/families/*/*/family.json) and trimmed copies
of registry/data/{replacements,family-tags,family-overrides}.json, from
https://github.com/fontsource/fontsource at commit
43cfc04f7f53ef63cc5781c018c4058d8908f485 (2026-09-23). Edits: designer names
left out (two families carry the placeholder "Fixture Designer"); web and email
addresses cut from license attributions; each family's language list cut to at
most six entries; only some source files kept; each kept file's unicodeRange
cut to its first four ranges, with codepoints set to match; OpenType feature
lists cut to three tags. The license.txt, description.en-US.md and
languages.json files are synthetic stand-ins for files the collector does not
check out.

http/fonts.json is five rows shaped like https://api.fontsource.org/v1/fonts:
google-sans and material-symbols are the API's rows of 2026-09-25 (google-sans
with fewer subsets); the other three are written from the registry data above.
The ETag in http/index.json is invented.

